// Refusal 1: two :: facts give one class two incomparable parents.
// F-logic is the only source form in this repo that can WRITE a second
// parent, so this fixture is where WF-106 is actually exercised.
RechtOpUitkering[|bedrag => numeriek(niet_negatief, 2)|].
RechtUitkeringZwWazo[|bedrag => numeriek(niet_negatief, 2)|].

RechtOpUitkeringWazo::RechtOpUitkering.
RechtOpUitkeringWazo::RechtUitkeringZwWazo.
